<p>
  <%= @group.name %> is asking whether <%= @event.ended? ? "you went to" : "you are coming to" %> <%= @event.name %>, <%= event_schedule_range(@event) %>.
</p>

<p>
  Answer on the event's page: <%= link_to group_event_url(@group, @event), group_event_url(@group, @event) %>
</p>

<p>
  If you are not signed in, the link opens the sign-in form first.
  Nothing is sent until you press the form's button, which emails you a sign-in link.
</p>
